    "title": "Syaahi — A Privacy-First Document Workspace",
    "serviceCategory": "Mobile App Development",
    "client": "Syaahi (Digital Product)",
    "description": "Syaahi is a privacy-first Android document and image management application developed by UNIQUOVA. It brings essential productivity tools into a single, easy-to-use workspace, allowing users to scan documents, extract Hindi and English text, create searchable PDFs, edit images, and manage files directly on their devices.\n\nThe project focuses on simplifying everyday document workflows while maintaining user privacy through local-first processing and zero mandatory cloud uploads for core features.\n\n**Project Scope:**\n- Document and ID card scanning with automatic edge detection and perspective correction.\n- Bilingual Hindi and English OCR with editable text extraction.\n- Searchable PDF creation, merging, splitting, compression, and password protection.\n- Image editing, cropping, resizing, compression, and enhancement filters.\n- Offline QR code and barcode generation and scanning.\n- ZIP file creation and SHA-256 file integrity checks.\n- Biometric application security and privacy-focused workspace management.\n- Light and dark themes based on the Ink × Paper design system.\n\nThe overall goal is to create a reliable, accessible, and privacy-conscious digital workspace for everyday document management.",
